      "text": "### API Intercept\n\nIntercepted backend HTTP response: POST /customer/disputes -> 201 SUCCESS trên đơn awaiting_payment\n\n**POST /customer/disputes -> 201 SUCCESS trên đơn awaiting_payment**\n\n- Failed Request: POST /customer/disputes -> 201 SUCCESS trên đơn awaiting_payment\n- Endpoint: POST /customer/disputes",
